iFixit is a global online platform providing repair manuals, tools, and replacement parts for electronics. The platform empowers users to repair products independently rather than relying on manufacturers or authorized repair centers. iFixit publishes detailed, step-by-step repair guides with photographs and videos, earning widespread adoption across product categories. The company pioneered the Repairability Index, scoring products on disassembly difficulty, part availability, and tool accessibility, creating market incentives for repair-friendly design. By providing access to information and parts, iFixit supports a decentralized repair ecosystem and extends product lifespans globally.